INSERT INTO article_matchups (id, article_id, position, slot_label, away_team_name, home_team_name, away_record, home_record, line, away_score, home_score, body)
VALUES
  ('487afb83-1f23-4356-9377-291ba87f4761', '013d3688-347b-4da2-91f1-e63bc8ffddbb', 1, 'PRIMETIME', 'Code Monkey (PR #414)', 'Bark For Daddy!🫵🐶', '6-2', '6-2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A tale as old as time, a song as old as rhyme, former lovers turned into a vehement disgust for one another. Ankith broke Kirk’s heart by leaving Cap One and going to milwake or something who knows what town that shit is. Kirk’s in Manhattan now care free. Anyways, there’s been some development on both sides for a running back deal after a catastrophic Skattebo injury. Much like our government though, it is looking like there is no end in sight. Code Monkey’s voodoo magic has changed the schedule so that he plays Saquon on a bye week which has been garnered a heavy fine, approved by the governing board of the league (pending commissioner review do not fine the writer of this preview). We’ll see what Barbie miracle can happen here as it’s halloween night and the paparazzi are trying to get pics of the reportedly sexy Ken costume. We don’t know what Ankith is dressing up as because he lives in a corn field now.'),
  ('4e63da4d-ecb4-4658-81c3-871b7c4c0fe3', '013d3688-347b-4da2-91f1-e63bc8ffddbb', 2, 'DraftKings Degen Gambler Special (CBS)', 'Indian DJ', 'Heterophobes Locked In', '3-5', '3-5', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Both teams here have the same record but vastly different stories to find themselves in this situation. Heterophobe fans are almost knocking down manager Joe Hong’s door in Charlotte. A security detail has been assigned, leaving many to believe that the new team’s rebranding will come true. It’s time to lock tf in and squeak out a win that could send him all the way to the top of the loser’s bracket.
Indian DJ has been looking good recently with Smith-Njigba (don’t ask me how to pronounce that shit) putting his heavy ass team on his back. Let’s see if he can do it again.'),
  ('d18a6c8b-faa1-4fa4-b07c-9084f8702aa7', '013d3688-347b-4da2-91f1-e63bc8ffddbb', 3, 'Shitter bowl (FOX)', 'Maye I Digg in yo Boutte', 'Stevenson and White Guys For', '2-6', '2-6', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This is a stellar bottom of the barrel scrap, with Revanth coming in slightly favored. It’s been quite a year for both teams so far and what could be considered a must win game to get competitive for a playoff spot.  Stevenson has not shown up all year (who would’ve guessed) and he probably wont this game as well but with Alvin’s newly constructed shrine of Stevenson at home he’s hopeful it will turn his luck around. Fans still don’t agree with Alvin’s deliberate copying of the name of a very famous team from last year and are calling for the manager’s departure.'),
  ('d986d2b4-2699-4610-a971-c3595db8cc22', '013d3688-347b-4da2-91f1-e63bc8ffddbb', 4, 'Mid Table Mommy Milkers Mayhem (NBC)', 'Nangali''s ''Naners', 'Jayden Jefferson Jr''s Mom', '3-5', '4-4', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A mid table battle is getting the fans all riled up for this one. Both managers feeling the pressure of the fans to lock into a playoff position. Nangali being in investment banking already is quite crushing, let’s see if he can take that pressure and make diamonds out of it, or probably just a hunk of fucking coal. Carter has been on some boating days and absolutely balling out with the huzz on his yacht, fans are hoping his neck doesn’t hurt too much if he spots a baddie from the dugout.'),
  ('25db42c6-edf4-42ca-ade2-c57dfd229bbd', '013d3688-347b-4da2-91f1-e63bc8ffddbb', 5, 'Amazon 5 Day RTO Special (Amazon)', 'It Hurts A Little', 'Smooth Jazz w Kenny G', '6-2', '4-4', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Old teammates on the IM nc state team clash head to head. Keshav is striving for a positive win rate from this game while Rishi is fighting hard to stay on par with Kirk’s stellar pace in the race to the top. With hurts on bye week it’s gonna hurt quite a bit this week against jamaar chase and crew. Let’s see if Keshav closes the gap this week. Analysts are saying Rishi’s superior performances in IM contribute to his superior record against Keshav.')
ON CONFLICT (article_id, position) DO NOTHING;

